### Task Type F — Compare AI-Generated Answers

Give me two different Dart implementations of the same problem.

Ask me to:

- Select the better implementation.
- Explain why.
- Identify errors in either answer.
- Identify missing edge cases.
- Compare time and space complexity.
- Suggest improvements.

